==Battleground==
*15 [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*10 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Lord Gravey]] spawns as the boss after 24 seconds<sup>720f</sup>.
*5 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Zory]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Zang Roo]] spawns after 96.67 seconds<sup>2,900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage becomes exponentially easier with [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]] and [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Polevaulter Cat]]. The biggest problem is the Zang Roo, who burrows beneath your defences, so be sure to bring [[Ototo Corps#Holy Blast|Holy Blast]] so as to not lose too much ground to her. Aside from this, bring your generic midrange and backline counters to Lord Gravey such as [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]] and [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] and victory will eventially be yours. Any dedicated anti-Zombies like [[Brainwashed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Whale Cat]] will help immensely.

